T1  - Remaining useful life prediction based on degradation-aware dynamic graph representation learning
AU  - Li, Qiang
AU  - Xiong, Xing
AU  - Ren, Junxiao
JO  - Engineering Applications of Artificial Intelligence
VL  - 163
SP  - 113140
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/01/01/
